asset:        ic_launcher.png
title:        EffectCraft app icon, Android mipmap-mdpi (48x48)
author:       EffectCraft contributors (drawing by the project owner in ArtCraft)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: assets/app-icon/LICENSE.txt
added:        2026-10-13 by EffectCraft contributors (Android launcher icon)
notes:        Launcher icon for the Android build, in the resource tree cargo apk passes to
              aapt -S. The sidecar is dot-prefixed because aapt rejects a second resource name
              per directory but skips dot files (see `cargo xtask assets` and packaging/icons.sh).
              Resized from the committed 1024 px render of effectcraft.svg with Lanczos
              resampling; packaging/icons.sh regenerates every density from that vector.
